### READ ALL MOVIES
GET {{localBaseUrl}}/movies

### READ SINGLE MOVIE BY ID (Back to the Future)
GET {{localBaseUrl}}/movies/6a2202b14be80c66150f5454

### UPDATE AN EXISTING MOVIE
